@startuml
title SgCategoryNewUser4All —— 闪购商家品类新客查询

autonumber

participant "调用方\n(发券/导购/查券链路)" as Caller
participant "NewService" as S
participant "userRetrieve\n(com.sankuai.wpt.user.retrieve)" as UserCenter
participant "uuid cellar\n(缓存)" as UuidCK
participant "TspKalaNewUserProxy\n(kela代理)" as KelaProxy
participant "TspKelaNewUserService\n(kela)" as Kela

note over S
  内部逻辑:
  1. 补全 phone 和 uuid
  2. 调 kela 查询新客类型
  3. 处理返回值,取 Map<NewUserType, Boolean>
end note

Caller -> S++: querySgCategoryNewUser(userId, phone, uuid, newUserTypeSet)

== 步骤1: 补全 phone 和 uuid ==

alt phone 为空 —— 查询用户手机号
  S -> UserCenter++: RpcUserRetrieveService.getUserByIdWithMsg(userId)
  note right: appkey: com.sankuai.wpt.user.retrieve\n超时: 200ms
  return phone
end

alt uuid 为空 —— cellar 查 uuid
  S -> UuidCK++: 读缓存查 uuid
  return uuid
end

== 步骤2: 调 kela 查询新客类型 ==

S -> KelaProxy++: getUserFirstOrder(userId, phone, uuid, newUserTypeSet)
note right: 参考调 c.coupon/guide TspKalaNewUserProxy#getUserFirstOrder调用方式

KelaProxy -> Kela++: queryMultipleNewUser(...)
note right: 业务线新客、门店新客、闪购商家品类新客\n均调用此接口\n超时: 200ms
return Map<NewUserType, Boolean>
return Map<NewUserType, Boolean>

== 步骤3: 处理返回值 ==

S -> S: 处理返回值,取 newUserResult\nkey=新客类型, value=是否新客

return Map<NewUserType, Boolean>

@enduml
